{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"fangji-p-9ee1cd1a0e9cef","name":"刘寔","evidence":["fangji-q-c0cb38d365a1f1f81a0c"],"facts":[{"id":"fangji-f-77b6626e7b162635fc5b","text":"裴松之释管辰所称乡里刘太常为刘寔。","evidence":["fangji-q-c0cb38d365a1f1f81a0c"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-c0cb38d365a1f1f81a0c","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-aa9e853e57c2b927ec50","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：辰所称“乡里刘太常者”，谓刘寔也；辰撰辂传，寔时为太常。“颍川”则寔弟智也。寔、智并以儒学为名，无能言之；《世语》称寔“博辩”，犹不足以并裴、何之流也。又按辂自说，云“本命在寅”，则建安十五年生也。至正始九年，应三十九，而传云三十六；以正元三年卒，应四十七，传云四十八：皆为不相应也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-66647f1ecb147317b0c6","start":0,"end":147}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
